<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
  <title>BangHeri AI — Agensi Otomasi & Kecerdasan Buatan Indonesia</title>
  <meta name="description" content="BangHeri AI membantu bisnis Indonesia lepas dari beban manual lewat otomasi dan AI. Didirikan Heri Rahmansyah, AI Engineer BNSP Certified. Deploy 48 jam, dampingan 30 hari." />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0E0F12" />

  <link rel="icon" href="favicon/favicon.ico" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="96x96" href="favicon/favicon-96x96.png" />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="favicon/favicon.svg" />
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="favicon/apple-touch-icon.png" />
  <link rel="manifest" href="favicon/site.webmanifest" />

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;1,300;1,400&family=DM+Mono:wght@300;400;500&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="scrollcraft.css" />

  <style>
    :root {
      --sc-canvas: #0E0F12; --sc-surface: #14161B; --sc-ink: #F5F5F7;
      --sc-ink-soft: #9E9E9E; --sc-accent: #C5A880; --sc-accent-ink: #0E0F12;
      --sc-accent-2: #E3DAC9;
      --sc-font-display: 'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
      --sc-font-text: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
      --sc-font-mono: 'DM Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
    }
    html, body {
      background: #0E0F12 !important; color: #F5F5F7;
      font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', system-ui, sans-serif; font-weight: 300;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; margin: 0; padding: 0; overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    img, video { display: block; max-width: 100%; }
    ::selection { background: #C5A880; color: #0E0F12; }
    .bh-gold-grad { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #E3DAC9 40%, #C5A880 70%, #A38558 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; }

    .bh-header { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100; background: rgba(14,15,18,0.78); backdrop-filter: blur(18px); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(197,168,128,0.14); }
    .bh-header__inner { max-width: 1720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 18px 40px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 32px; }
    .bh-brand { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; }
    .bh-brand__line1 { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: #F5F5F7; line-height: 1; }
    .bh-brand__line1 small { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.32em; color: #9E9E9E; margin-left: 8px; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .bh-brand__line2 { font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 8.5px; letter-spacing: 0.32em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #C5A880; }
    .bh-nav { display: flex; gap: 32px; align-items: center; }
    .bh-nav a { font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.24em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9E9E9E; transition: color 0.3s; }
    .bh-nav a:hover { color: #C5A880; }
    .bh-cta { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 9px 18px; border: 1px solid rgba(197,168,128,0.5); font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F5F5F7; transition: all 0.3s; }
    .bh-cta:hover { background: #C5A880; color: #0E0F12; border-color: #C5A880; }
    .bh-cta__dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #C5A880; animation: bhPulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite; }
    .bh-cta:hover .bh-cta__dot { background: #0E0F12; }
    @keyframes bhPulse { 0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); } 50% { opacity: 0.35; transform: scale(1.6); } }

    .bh-rail { position: fixed; right: 26px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); z-index: 60; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px; align-items: center; }
    .bh-rail__node { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid rgba(197,168,128,0.4); background: transparent; transition: all 0.4s; position: relative; cursor: pointer; }
    .bh-rail__node::after { content: attr(data-label); position: absolute; right: 20px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 0.24em; color: #9E9E9E; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s; white-space: nowrap; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .bh-rail__node:hover::after { opacity: 1; }
    .bh-rail__node.is-active { background: #C5A880; border-color: #C5A880; box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(197,168,128,0.6); }

    .bh-progress { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; height: 2px; width: 0%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #C5A880 0%, #E3DAC9 100%); z-index: 200; }
    .bh-hud { position: fixed; right: 26px; bottom: 26px; z-index: 90; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; padding: 10px 18px; background: rgba(14,15,18,0.85); backdrop-filter: blur(14px); border: 1px solid rgba(197,168,128,0.22); }
    .bh-hud__coord { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 8.5px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: #9E9E9E; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .bh-hud__coord b { color: #F5F5F7; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.12em; }
    .bh-hud__pct { font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #C5A880; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
    .bh-hud__pct small { font-size: 9px; color: #9E9E9E; margin-left: 2px; }

    .bh-hero { position: relative; width: 100%; height: 100vh; overflow: hidden; }
    .bh-hero__bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 60%; filter: brightness(0.55) contrast(1.05) saturate(0.9); transform: scale(1.04); }
    .bh-hero__vignette { position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(14,15,18,0.9) 0%, rgba(14,15,18,0.55) 40%, rgba(14,15,18,0.15) 72%, transparent 100%), linear-gradient(0deg, #0E0F12 0%, transparent 32%), linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(14,15,18,0.5) 0%, transparent 25%); }
    .bh-hero__content { position: relative; z-index: 10; max-width: 1720px; height: 100%; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
    .bh-hero__inner { max-width: 640px; }
    .bh-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; padding: 6px 14px; background: rgba(20,22,27,0.78); border: 1px solid rgba(197,168,128,0.32); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); margin-bottom: 26px; }
    .bh-badge__dot { width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: #C5A880; box-shadow: 0 0 8px #C5A880; }
    .bh-badge span { font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.28em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #C5A880; }
    .bh-h1 { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 74px); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -0.015em; margin: 0 0 22px 0; color: #F5F5F7; }
    .bh-h1 em { display: block; }
    .bh-hero__sub { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.7; color: #D1D1D6; max-width: 520px; margin: 0 0 32px 0; }
    .bh-hero__stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; padding-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 34px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(197,168,128,0.24); max-width: 640px; }
    .bh-stat__label { display: block; font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.24em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9E9E9E; margin-bottom: 5px; }
    .bh-stat__val { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 300; color: #F5F5F7; line-height: 1; display: inline-flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 5px; }
    .bh-stat__val small { font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: #C5A880; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .bh-hero__actions { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
    .bh-btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 10.5px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 15px 30px; transition: all 0.35s; }
    .bh-btn--solid { background: #C5A880; color: #0E0F12; font-weight: 500; border: 1px solid #C5A880; }
    .bh-btn--solid:hover { background: #E3DAC9; border-color: #E3DAC9; }
    .bh-btn--ghost { background: transparent; color: #F5F5F7; border: 1px solid rgba(197,168,128,0.4); }
    .bh-btn--ghost:hover { border-color: #C5A880; background: rgba(197,168,128,0.06); }
    .bh-hero__cue { position: absolute; left: 40px; bottom: 26px; z-index: 10; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .bh-hero__cue-line { width: 1px; height: 34px; background: #C5A880; opacity: 0.7; animation: bhCue 2.4s ease-in-out infinite; }
    @keyframes bhCue { 0%, 100% { transform: scaleY(0.6); transform-origin: top; } 50% { transform: scaleY(1); } }
    .bh-hero__cue span { font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.28em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #C5A880; }

    .bh-section { position: relative; width: 100%; padding: 120px 40px; background: #0E0F12; border-top: 1px solid rgba(197,168,128,0.1); }
    .bh-section__inner { max-width: 1720px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .bh-sec-tag { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .bh-sec-tag__num { font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #C5A880; }
    .bh-sec-tag__ln { width: 56px; height: 1px; background: rgba(197,168,128,0.3); }
    .bh-sec-title { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: clamp(34px, 4.5vw, 58px); font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.1; color: #F5F5F7; margin: 0 0 18px 0; letter-spacing: -0.01em; max-width: 24ch; }
    .bh-sec-title em { font-style: italic; }
    .bh-sec-lede { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.75; color: #D1D1D6; max-width: 56ch; margin: 0 0 60px 0; }

    .bh-services { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1px; background: rgba(197,168,128,0.14); border: 1px solid rgba(197,168,128,0.14); }
    .bh-service { background: #0E0F12; padding: 36px 32px; transition: background 0.35s; }
    .bh-service:hover { background: #14161B; }
    .bh-service__head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 18px; padding-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); }
    .bh-service__num { font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.24em; color: #C5A880; }
    .bh-service__tag { font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: #9E9E9E; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .bh-service__title { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.15; color: #F5F5F7; margin: 0 0 12px 0; }
    .bh-service__desc { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.7; color: #A0A0A6; margin: 0; }

    .bh-featured__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 460px) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 60px; align-items: flex-start; }
    .bh-frame { position: relative; border: 1px solid rgba(197,168,128,0.28); background: #14161B; padding: 10px; }
    .bh-frame__img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4/3; object-fit: cover; filter: brightness(0.88) contrast(1.05) saturate(0.85); }
    .bh-frame__cap { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-top: 14px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9E9E9E; }
    .bh-frame__cap b { color: #C5A880; font-weight: 400; }
    .bh-frame__cross-tl, .bh-frame__cross-tr, .bh-frame__cross-bl, .bh-frame__cross-br { position: absolute; width: 12px; height: 12px; border-color: #C5A880; border-style: solid; border-width: 0; pointer-events: none; }
    .bh-frame__cross-tl { top: -1px; left: -1px; border-top-width: 2px; border-left-width: 2px; }
    .bh-frame__cross-tr { top: -1px; right: -1px; border-top-width: 2px; border-right-width: 2px; }
    .bh-frame__cross-bl { bottom: -1px; left: -1px; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-left-width: 2px; }
    .bh-frame__cross-br { bottom: -1px; right: -1px; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-right-width: 2px; }

    .bh-steps { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px; }
    .bh-step { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr; gap: 20px; padding-bottom: 26px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(197,168,128,0.12); }
    .bh-step:last-child { border-bottom: 0; padding-bottom: 0; }
    .bh-step__num { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 38px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1; color: #C5A880; opacity: 0.6; }
    .bh-step__title { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 400; color: #F5F5F7; margin: 0 0 6px 0; }
    .bh-step__desc { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.65; color: #A0A0A6; margin: 0; }

    .bh-testimonials { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 24px; }
    .bh-quote { position: relative; padding: 36px 32px; background: #14161B; border: 1px solid rgba(197,168,128,0.16); transition: border-color 0.35s, transform 0.35s; }
    .bh-quote:hover { border-color: rgba(197,168,128,0.4); transform: translateY(-3px); }
    .bh-quote__mark { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 60px; line-height: 0.6; color: #C5A880; opacity: 0.4; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .bh-quote__text { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 300; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.5; color: #E3DAC9; margin: 0 0 26px 0; }
    .bh-quote__author { padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }
    .bh-quote__name { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; color: #F5F5F7; margin: 0 0 4px 0; }
    .bh-quote__role { font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #C5A880; margin: 0; }

    .bh-proof__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 420px) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 72px; align-items: center; }
    .bh-proof__portrait { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 4/5; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(197,168,128,0.28); background: #14161B; }
    .bh-proof__portrait img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 20%; filter: brightness(0.92) contrast(1.08) saturate(1.05); }
    .bh-proof__portrait::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(14,15,18,0.65) 0%, transparent 40%); pointer-events: none; }
    .bh-proof__caption { position: absolute; left: 22px; bottom: 22px; z-index: 2; font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.24em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #C5A880; }
    .bh-badges { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 32px; }
    .bh-chip { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 8px 14px; background: rgba(20,22,27,0.6); border: 1px solid rgba(197,168,128,0.28); font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #E3DAC9; }
    .bh-chip__dot { width: 4px; height: 4px; border-radius: 50%; background: #C5A880; }

    .bh-contact__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 420px); gap: 72px; align-items: center; }
    .bh-contact__details { margin-top: 36px; padding-top: 28px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(197,168,128,0.14); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
    .bh-contact__row { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; }
    .bh-contact__row-lbl { font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.24em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9E9E9E; min-width: 88px; }
    .bh-contact__row a, .bh-contact__row span { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 400; color: #F5F5F7; transition: color 0.3s; }
    .bh-contact__row a:hover { color: #C5A880; }

    .bh-footer { background: #0E0F12; border-top: 1px solid rgba(197,168,128,0.14); padding: 56px 40px 40px 40px; }
    .bh-footer__inner { max-width: 1720px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .bh-footer__top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 32px; flex-wrap: wrap; padding-bottom: 32px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); }
    .bh-footer__brand { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: #F5F5F7; }
    .bh-footer__brand small { display: block; font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 8.5px; letter-spacing: 0.32em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #C5A880; margin-top: 5px; }
    .bh-footer__links { display: flex; gap: 28px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .bh-footer__links a { color: #9E9E9E; transition: color 0.3s; }
    .bh-footer__links a:hover { color: #C5A880; }
    .bh-footer__bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 32px; flex-wrap: wrap; padding-top: 24px; font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: #5C5D62; text-transform: uppercase; }

    @media (max-width: 1100px) {
      .bh-nav { display: none; }
      .bh-services { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
      .bh-testimonials { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .bh-featured__grid, .bh-proof__grid, .bh-contact__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 44px; }
      .bh-proof__portrait { max-width: 380px; margin: 0 auto; }
      .bh-hero__stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .bh-header__inner, .bh-hero__content, .bh-section, .bh-footer { padding-left: 22px; padding-right: 22px; }
      .bh-hero__cue { left: 22px; }
      .bh-services { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .bh-rail { display: none; }
      .bh-hud { right: 12px; bottom: 12px; padding: 8px 12px; }
      .bh-hud__coord { display: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="bh-progress" data-sc-progress></div>

  <header class="bh-header">
    <div class="bh-header__inner">
      <a href="#identity" class="bh-brand">
        <span class="bh-brand__line1"><b>BangHeri</b><small>AI</small></span>
        <span class="bh-brand__line2">Agensi Otomasi &amp; Kecerdasan Buatan</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="bh-nav">
        <a href="#identity">01 Beranda</a>
        <a href="#thesis">02 Layanan</a>
        <a href="#featured">03 Hasil</a>
        <a href="#proof">04 Founder</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="bh-cta">
          <span>Konsultasi Gratis</span>
          <span class="bh-cta__dot"></span>
        </a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <nav class="bh-rail" aria-hidden="true">
    <a href="#identity" class="bh-rail__node is-active" data-label="Beranda" data-target="identity"></a>
    <a href="#thesis" class="bh-rail__node" data-label="Layanan" data-target="thesis"></a>
    <a href="#featured" class="bh-rail__node" data-label="Hasil" data-target="featured"></a>
    <a href="#collection" class="bh-rail__node" data-label="Testimoni" data-target="collection"></a>
    <a href="#proof" class="bh-rail__node" data-label="Founder" data-target="proof"></a>
    <a href="#contact" class="bh-rail__node" data-label="Kontak" data-target="contact"></a>
  </nav>

  <div class="bh-hud">
    <div class="bh-hud__coord"><span>Lokasi</span><b>Jakarta · GMT+7</b></div>
    <div class="bh-hud__pct"><span data-sc-hud-pct>00</span><small>%</small></div>
  </div>

  <main>
    <section id="identity" class="bh-hero" data-sc-act="pin" data-sc-span="1.25">
      <div data-sc-stage>
        <img src="assets/hero.webp" alt="Sirkuit Mandalika — metafora kecepatan dan presisi" class="bh-hero__bg" fetchpriority="high" />
        <div class="bh-hero__vignette"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="bh-hero__content">
        <div class="bh-hero__inner">
          <div class="bh-badge" data-sc-in><span class="bh-badge__dot"></span><span>BNSP Certified · AI Engineer</span></div>
          <h1 class="bh-h1" data-sc-kinetic="lines" data-sc-cue="0.05 0.5">Masih kerjakan<br><em class="bh-gold-grad">hal sama berulang?</em></h1>
          <p class="bh-hero__sub" data-sc-in>Enam layanan otomasi yang dirancang sesuai skala bisnis Indonesia. Tidak ada paket generik — hanya otomasi yang langsung jalan, dalam 48 jam.</p>
          <div class="bh-hero__stats" data-sc-in data-sc-stagger="70">
